OL,3,GNEWSANoisy exhausts causing anxiety,
OL,4,Apolice boss says
OL,5,
OL,6,FExcessively noisy vehicle exhausts are
OL,7,Fcausing "anxiety and stress" to
OL,8,Fresidents, according to the results of
OL,9,Fa survey by a police and crime
OL,10,Fcommissioner (PCC).
OL,12,FDonna Jones, who represents Hampshire
OL,13,Fand Isle of Wight, is campaigning for a
OL,14,Flegally enforceable roadside decibel
OL,15,F(dB) limit, without which she said
OL,16,Fmakes it difficult for police forces to
OL,17,Fcombat the problem.
OL,19,FShe said more than 4,400 people took
OL,20,Fpart in a survey, showing the issue
OL,21,F"affects wellbeing, road safety and
OL,22,Fquality of life".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
