OL,3,GNEWSANoisy exhausts causing anxiety,
OL,4,Apolice boss says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) has
OL,7,Fpreviously said noisy exhausts were a
OL,8,F"nuisance" and said officers have a
OL,9,Frange of powers to combat anti-social
OL,10,Fdriving.
